  {
    "number": 10,
    "title": "Oligo-mtDSB: Inside out model",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": "Collaboration with Roberta Brambilla",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "mtDNA DSBs are specifically induced in myelinating oligodendrocytes",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "Reported demyelination, axonal injury and inflammation",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "\u2192 mtDNA damage can cause oligodendrocyte death",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "Models inside out paradigm",
            "level": 0
          }
        ]
      },
