  {
    "number": 13,
    "title": "Age and condition comparison (within OLs)",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": "Basic built in comparison of condition and age:",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "Control 21 d vs rest: Mbp, Mog, Cnp \u2192 mature myelinating profile",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "Control 60 d vs rest: Induction of Sgk1, Ddit4, Hspa1a/b, Dnajb1 (age-related stress?)",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "mtDSB 21 d vs rest: Upregulation of Ddit4, Sod2, Zfp36, Kdr, Aqp4, early mitochondrial and oxidative stress?",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "mtDSB 60 d vs rest: Strong Hsph1, Hspa1a/b, Atf4, Serpina3n, Dnajb1 \u2192 integrated stress response?",
            "level": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
