  },
  {
    "number": 16,
    "title": "Astrocytes show late stress and metal-response activation with reduced metabolic and glial homeostasis genes",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": "Reactive gliosis persists \u2192 Gfap, Selenop, Qdpr",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "Mitochondrial & ISR adaptation \u2192 Mt2, Tsc22d3",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "Homeostatic & metabolic genes decline \u2192 Slc1a3, Slc6a11, Sox9, Gja1",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "Stress resolution trend \u2192 Ddit4, Mertk, Ptgds down",
            "level": 0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
