  {
    "number": 19,
    "title": "Transcriptional remodeling across CNS cell types \n",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": "Oligodendrocytes: ISR + glycolytic activation (Atf4, Aldoa, Mt2); myelin loss (Mbp, Mag, Cldn11).",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "OPCs: Stress and ISR genes \u2191 (Hspa5, Gfap); maturation markers \u2193 (Olig2, Plp1, Mbp).",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "Astrocytes: Oxidative-metal stress \u2191 (Gfap, Mt2); metabolic support \u2193 (Slc1a3, Gja1).",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "Microglia: Homeostatic markers \u2193 (P2ry12, Siglech); MHC + stress genes \u2191 (B2m, H2-D1).",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "Neurons (MSNs): Stress genes \u2191 (Hspa5, Aldoa, Mt2); synaptic identity \u2193 (Adora2a, Pdyn).",
            "level": 0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": "Inside out model",
            "level": 0
          }
        ]
      }
