          {
            "text": "Collaboration started before my time in GCB lab",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "ST data from mouse brain sections treated with Brichos",
            "level": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "Brichos, a molecular chaperone has been shown to breaks the catalytic cycle that generates toxic A\u03b2 oligomers",
